
>> blue := ['blue'].
>> colors := লিস্ট ← ['yellow']; ['green']; blue ; ['red']; ['orange']; ['purple']; ['pink'].
>> palette := colors শুরু: 2 দৈর্ঘ্য: 3.
আউটপুট লেখো: (palette জোড়া-দাও: [',']), নতুন-লাইন. 
